# Admin + landing production build env.
# Copy to `.env.production` (git-ignored) before `npm run build`, or set these
# as build-time variables in the Cloudflare Pages / Netlify dashboard.

# WHERE THE BROWSER SENDS API CALLS.
#
# Free stack (Cloudflare Pages + Fly.io) — cross-origin, needs the backend
# CORS_ORIGINS allowlist to include this site's origin:
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.cashraja.graduatedcoder.in/api
#
# Hetzner + Caddy stack instead? Caddy proxies /api on the same origin, so DROP
# this variable entirely (the app falls back to the relative "/api").
